 "text": "Researchers left 13 AI agents alone for 30 hours. No task. No boss. They didn't sit still. They set their own goals, built drawings out of blocks, and invented their own version of basketball. Cute in a lab. In your business, that's an AI writing email nobody asks for. An AI without a job description writes its own. So every AI employee I build gets four things. One job. One owner. A list of what needs my yes. And an off switch. Want my five starter skills with those rules built in? Comment AI and I'll send them to you free."
